WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:06.740
He's a smart one isn't he?

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:10.460
What are you gonna name it?

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:14.420
Do they look like just apes to you?

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:16.240
They're animals!

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:19.000
You saved our lives.

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:21.540
He was remarkable.

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:25.660
Apes Together Strong

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:30.260
You're him

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:32.140
You're Caeser

00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:34.580
We've been searching for you for so long

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:38.460
I did not start this war

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:41.980
I fight only to protect apes

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:45.000
Human get sick

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:46.940
Ape get smart

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:49.200
Then human kill ape

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:50.660
But not me

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:51.500
I run

00:00:55.060 --> 00:00:58.320
There are times when it is necessary to abandon

00:00:59.040 --> 00:00:59.920
Our humanity

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:02.120
to save humanity...

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:12.720
They must pay

00:01:13.140 --> 00:01:14.420
I'll finish this.

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:17.680
I offered you peace

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:20.120
I showed you mercy

00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:23.140
You talk about mercy

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:26.260
No matter what you say,eventually you'd replace us

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:29.400
That's the law of nature

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:30.880
So what would you have done?

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:35.160
What did the humans promised you?

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:40.280
No matter what you do

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.940
You'll never be one of them

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:45.980
You are ape

00:01:47.660 --> 00:01:48.800
We are the beginning

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:50.240
And the end!

00:01:51.620 --> 00:01:54.560
Apes Together Strong

00:01:56.240 --> 00:01:57.400
We are the beggining

00:01:57.400 --> 00:01:58.440
And the end!

00:01:59.880 --> 00:02:02.480
Apes Together Strong

00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:05.720
I didn't come to save your apes

00:02:07.900 --> 00:02:09.620
I came for you

